SUMMARY:Introduction to Machine Sewing at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking to build or refresh your machine sewing skills? In this three hour workshop we will cover basic sewing machine setup\, care\, and sewing techniques for seams\, mending\, basting and other applications. After a brief demonstration on how to use your sewing machine\, you will practice setting up the machine and practice stitching. You will also learn and practice decorative and other useful stitching techniques. Learn more on our website and register today. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/introduction-to-machine-sewing-at-pcad/
LOCATION:Pennsylvania College of Art & Design – Center for Creative Exploration\, 204 North Prince Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
