SUMMARY:Study Hall: Spirits & Signatures
DESCRIPTION:You know the names. You know the drinks. But do you know the stories behind them? Join us at The Conway Room for Spirits & Signatures\, a playful\, interactive evening exploring the trademarks\, iconic cocktails\, and recognizable brands that have shaped drinking culture through the years. From signature drinks to the stories behind some of the world’s best-known spirits brands\, this Study Hall takes a closer look at how cocktails and trademarks become icons. Discover the history\, branding\, and culture behind familiar names while putting your own knowledge to the test along the way. Expect an engaging mix of cocktail education\, surprising stories\, and interactive fun—all in the welcoming atmosphere of The Conway Room. Whether you’re a cocktail enthusiast\, a curious sipper\, or simply interested in the stories behind the brands you know\, there’s something new to discover. Come curious and leave with a new appreciation for the names behind your favorite drinks. Reservations are required. Reserve your seat and join us for Study Hall. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/study-hall-spirits-signatures/
LOCATION:The Conway Room\, 28 E King Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/IG-Post-Template-7.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Conway Social Club":MAILTO:conway@tfbhospitality.com
END:VEVENT
