SUMMARY:Two Dudes Color Mix
DESCRIPTION:Two Dudes and Sherwin-Williams present Color Mix\, an immersive color experience at Demuth Museum of Art on Lime. \n\n\n\nTwo Dudes Painting Company and Sherwin-Williams present Color Mix\, an immersive color experience at the Demuth Museum of Art on Lime. For one night only\, join local and regional interior designers\, architects\, contractors\, and painters for an interactive exploration of Sherwin-Williams’ 2027 colors of the year. \n\n\n\nWhat To Expect: \n\n\n\n\nImmersive Color Experience\, courtesy of Lancaster-based interior design firms\n\n\n\nCash Bar\n\n\n\nCotton Candy by Little Cotton Candy Cart\n\n\n\nLive Music\n\n\n\nNetworking with local home renovation experts\n\n\n\n\nFeatured Designers: \n\n\n\nDavid Lyall \n\n\n\nHenrietta Heisler Interiors \n\n\n\nBeers + Hoffman Architecture \n\n\n\nAK Interiors \n\n\n\nVille & Rue \n\n\n\nTONO Group \n\n\n\n\n    reserve your spot
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/two-dudes-color-mix/
LOCATION:Demuth Museum of Art on Lime\, 135 North Lime Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
