SUMMARY:Water Street's Evening Of Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Come be apart of a one-night event focused on the work ahead as Water Street continues to walk with neighbors facing homelessness\, poverty\, and hardship. \n\n\n\nThrough this evening\, Water Street Mission invites you to journey with them as they fight\, in the power God gives\, against the homelessness crisis in our community. \n\n\n\nExperience immersive We Don’t Give Up exhibits that walk through the journey from homelessness to restoration at Water Street. You’ll also hear stories of lives being restored\, receive an update from President Jack Crowley\, and have the opportunity to double your impact through a one-night-only matching challenge. \n\n\n\nJoin Water Street Mission for: \n\n\n\n• Three-course dinner• Immersive We Don’t Give Up exhibits• Stories of restoration and perseverance• Special update from Jack Crowley• One-night-only matching opportunit \n\n\n\n\n    register
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/water-streets-evening-of-celebration-2/
LOCATION:Lancaster Marriott at Penn Square\, 25 S Queen Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-05-at-1.40.22-PM.png
END:VEVENT
