SUMMARY:Winter Potting Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Create your own stunning winter planter at our Winter Potting Workshop. Guided by our expert design team\, you’ll craft festive\, evergreen arrangements that bring beauty and warmth to your outdoor spaces all winter long.\n\nIn this hands-on workshop\, you’ll learn:\n\nEvergreen Design Basics – Build a lush\, lasting base of evergreens for vibrant\, seasonal displays.\n\nArranging Outdoor-Grade Winter Accents – Add dazzle to your design with elements like pine cones\, pods\, berries\, and branches that endure the cold\, rain and snow.\n\nPro Tips for Longevity – Learn our winter maintenance tricks from 16+ years of gardening in PA.\n\nWhether you’re a seasoned gardener or just starting out\, our team will guide you in creating beautiful evergreen planters designs that wow all winter long.\n\nSeats are limited — secure your spot today and get ready to welcome winter with style and creativity!
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/winter-potting-workshop/
LOCATION:Perfect Pots Greenhouse\, 745 Strasburg Pike\, Strasburg\, PA\, 17579\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
ORGANIZER;CN="Perfect Pots":MAILTO:marketing@perfectpots.com
END:VEVENT
