SUMMARY:Needle Felting Workshop - Fall Acorns (Adult Event)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fall workshop where we’ll be needle felting our very own acorns in a decorative wood bowl! This beginner-friendly class will introduce you to the basics of needle felting as we transform soft wool into acorns using real acorn caps. We will also flat felt micro designs of your choosing inside acorn caps as lovely accents. This will be an adults-only workshop\, for ages 21+. Participants may bring their own food and alcoholic or n/a beverages to enjoy during the workshop. Minimum of 3 participants for class to run. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/needle-felting-workshop-fall-acorns-adult-event/
LOCATION:The Felted Fox\, 2029 Miller Rd.\, East Petersburg\, PA\, 17520\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/acorns.avif
END:VEVENT
