SUMMARY:Heartland Marimba International Festival Orchestra
DESCRIPTION:Immerse yourself in the sights and sounds of an international gathering of more than 50 marimba performers.  \n\n\n\nPROGRAM: – Fluidity by Steven Simpson – Juba from Piano Quintet in A by Florence Price/arranged by Chandler Beaugrand  – Trois Mouvements de Petrouchka\, Movements 1 & 2 by Igor Stravinsky/arr. David Harvey  – Venetian Waltz by Elijah Caligiuri – The Giver of Stars by Jenni Brandon – Preludium and Allegro by Fritz Kreisler/arr. David Harvey – Concerto for Cimbalom; Mvt. III by Alexander Timofeev/arr. Matthew Coley – Fantezie by Sergiu Crețu/arr. Coley \n\n\n\n Tickets: Adults $38 • Students and Seniors: $24 https://www.etix.com/ticket/p/85626538/ \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
