SUMMARY:Lancaster County Women for Good Gather & Grant
DESCRIPTION:FREE to attend and open to the public. Feel free to invite a friend!\n \nGATHER | We will network and connect with one another while we learn about 3 nonprofit finalists that our members have nominated for their positive impact in our community.\n \nGRANT | We will vote to award a majority of the grant to one deserving nonprofit. And no one leaves empty-handed! A smaller appreciation gift will also be awarded to the remaining 2 finalists.\n \nWant to get involved?– Be a force for good! Become a member by donating $50/quarter. Members can vote and nominate nonprofits for our quarterly grants.– Join us! Attend our Gather & Grant or another upcoming event. This is a great opportunity to make connections in the community and learn more about LCWG and the nonprofits we support.– Learn more! Visit our website: lancowomenforgood.com
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lancaster-county-women-for-good-gather-grant/2026-11-11/
LOCATION:Southern Market\, 100 South Queen Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2025/02/LCWG-Be-A-Force-for-Good-Cover-1920-x-1080-px.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Lancaster County Women for Good":MAILTO:lancowomenforgood@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
